<script setup lang="ts">import {fmt,percent} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{pairResult:any}>();</script><template><section class="pair-agreement"><div class="section-head"><h2>对标记者 Cohen κ：只用两人共同有票的试样。</h2><span>缺票不是类别；排除试样逐号可对账</span></div><article v-for="p in pairResult.pairs" :key="p.rater_a+'-'+p.rater_b" class="pair-card"><header><strong>{{p.rater_a}} × {{p.rater_b}}</strong><span>纳入 {{p.included_count}} · 排除 {{p.excluded_count}} / 面板共 {{pairResult.panel_specimen_count}} 试样</span></header><dl class="pair-metrics"><div><dt>Cohen κ</dt><dd>{{p.computable?fmt(p.kappa,6):'未定义'}}</dd></div><div><dt>观察一致率 Po</dt><dd>{{fmt(p.observed_agreement,6)}}</dd></div><div><dt>机会一致率 Pe</dt><dd>{{fmt(p.chance_agreement,6)}}</dd></div><div><dt>一致试样</dt><dd>{{p.agreements}}<em> / {{p.included_count}}</em></dd></div></dl><p v-if="!p.computable" class="invalid-reason">无法计算：{{p.undefined_reason}}</p><div v-if="p.confusion_matrix" class="confusion-wrap"><table class="confusion"><caption>混淆矩阵（行={{p.rater_a}}，列={{p.rater_b}}）</caption><thead><tr><th></th><th v-for="c in p.categories" :key="c">{{c}}</th><th>行计</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(row,i) in p.confusion_matrix" :key="i"><th>{{p.categories[i]}}</th><td v-for="(cell,j) in row" :key="j" :class="{diag:i===j}">{{cell}}</td><th>{{p.rater_a_totals[i]}}</th></tr><tr><th>列计</th><th v-for="(t,j) in p.rater_b_totals" :key="j">{{t}}</th><th>{{p.included_count}}</th></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="pair-bootstrap"><small>整试样重采样（池={{p.bootstrap.resampling_pool_size}}，B={{p.bootstrap.requested_repeats}}，seed={{p.bootstrap.seed}}）</small><strong v-if="p.bootstrap.interval">95%区间 [{{fmt(p.bootstrap.interval[0],6)}}, {{fmt(p.bootstrap.interval[1],6)}}]</strong><strong v-else>区间暂不报告</strong><span>有效 {{p.bootstrap.valid_repeats}} / {{p.bootstrap.requested_repeats}}（{{percent(p.bootstrap.valid_fraction)}}）· 退化 {{p.bootstrap.invalid_repeats}}，未补抽</span><p class="invalid-reason" v-for="(count,reason) in p.bootstrap.invalid_reasons" :key="reason">{{reason}}：{{count}} 次</p><p class="interval-reason">{{p.bootstrap.interval_reason}}</p></div><details><summary>纳入与排除试样对账（共{{p.included_count+p.excluded_count}}号）</summary><div class="reconcile"><span class="recon-in">纳入：{{p.included_references.join('、')||'（无）'}}</span><span class="recon-out" v-for="e in p.excluded_specimens" :key="e.reference">排除 {{e.reference}}（缺 {{e.missing_raters.join('、')}} 票）</span></div><details class="rep-detail"><summary>前16次重复：抽取索引、κ与失败理由</summary><div class="replicate-line" v-for="r in p.bootstrap.replicates.slice(0,16)" :key="r.repeat"><strong>#{{r.repeat}} {{r.valid?fmt(r.kappa,6):'未定义'}}</strong><span>{{r.reason||'有效'}} / 抽取位置 {{r.sample_indices.slice(0,12).join(', ')||'（空池）'}}{{r.sample_indices.length>12?' …':''}}</span></div></details></details></article><p class="pair-interpretation">{{pairResult.interpretation}}</p></section></template>
